WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.080
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:01.940
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.640
And today we have the final match of Giant Ping Pong!

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.680
We have both beaten Miikka

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.300
So now it's time
for me and Emil go head-to-head!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.860
Let's go!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.660
I thought that you were going around the net!

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.140
Run, run, run! Good try!

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.260
Wow!

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.980
There is a hole in the racket!

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.160
Sorry! It hit the edge.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.320
Good match!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:36.520
I think it was Otto's backhand that was a bit too powerful for me today.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.620
Yeah, you had to run a lot because of it.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.360
Yeah

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.480
There is still 78 percent of you guys who have not subscribed to our channel

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.200
So remember to do that here!

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.160
And watch the previous episodes there!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.860
Until next time!

